14. Success Criteria

The system is successful when:

Two users connect
One is actor, one is audience
Both see the same fire
Actor sends a message (“Once, by this fire…”)
Audience perceives it
Audience reacts (e.g., clap)
Actor/director can perceive that reaction

If that works:

the system lives